+- **Keep the active dock background in the widget content window.**
+  The frame-owned Canvas failed repeatedly in a real session: widget
+  extents grew while the background retained its old paint. Qt tests of
+  the isolated Canvas passed, so changing geometry formulas did not fix
+  the integration. `frameOwnsDockChrome` is now false: the existing
+  BarPanel rectangles and shoulder shapes follow the same live geometry
+  and window as the widgets. The FrameWindow dock must remain disabled
+  in this mode to avoid painting a second, stale dock underneath it.
